and the economic development director within that department, the health director, and I know you already have some comments but if if the health director could make those comments, tailor them to the idea that we're only talking about the one day and special events because I think that may help solve some of those questions about the timeline and the five days like we're not going to do that it's just one day and special events and what would the process be.

