And, you know, I had a conversation with the gentleman that came here for the coffee cart and the discussion we had was he owns a brick and mortar business and realizing that even $30 a day from one of the businesses is $150 a week, which is, you know, another six to $700 a month that could affect their bottom line.

413
00:40:20,845 --> 00:40:22,506
And he realized that

